<style>
.projects h2{margin:0 0 .25em}.projects .pg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:0 0 1.6em;padding:0;list-style:none}
.projects .pc{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(127,127,127,.14);border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.3)}
.projects .pc .ph{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.projects .pc img{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;object-fit:contain;background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);padding:3px;flex:none}
.projects .pc b{font-size:1.05em;line-height:1.15}.projects .pc .tag{font-size:.8em;opacity:.75;display:block}
.projects .pc p{margin:0;font-size:.85em;line-height:1.45;opacity:.9}.projects .pc a.go{align-self:flex-start;font-size:.8em;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:9px;background:rgba(17,133,254,.9);color:#fff}
.projects .badge{display:inline-block;margin-left:6px;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:9px;background:#ff5fa8;color:#fff;font-size:.6em;vertical-align:middle;letter-spacing:.06em}
</style>
<div class="projects">
<h2>Todd's Projects</h2>
<p>Everything I build, free to use. Post smarter, read cleaner, play harder.</p>
<h3>Photography</h3>
<ul class="pg">
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/twilightscapes.png" alt=""><div><b>Twilightscapes</b><span class="tag">Night photography, and the field kit that made it</span></div></div><p>Decades of photographing the world after dark — ghost towns, lonely churches, desert geology, the Milky Way — plus the Twilightscapes app for iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV and Apple Watch: a night camera, a pocket editing suite and an ambient gallery for every screen.</p><a class="go" href="https://twilightscapes.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See the work →</a></li>
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/urbanfetish.png" alt=""><div><b>UrbanFetish</b><span class="tag">Urban exploration art and photography</span></div></div><p>Abandoned places, industrial decay and the city at its rawest, as art and photography.</p><a class="go" href="https://urbanfetish.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore →</a></li>
</ul>
<h3>Post, share and keep up</h3>
<ul class="pg">
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/skypost.png" alt=""><div><b>SkyPost</b><span class="tag">The power-user Bluesky client</span></div></div><p>Edit and schedule posts, customize link and video previews, manage tags and mentions, build squads of your favorite people. Web, Mac, iPhone and Apple Watch.</p><a class="go" href="https://skypost.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open SkyPost →</a></li>
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/skypoll.png" alt=""><div><b>SkyPoll</b><span class="tag">Polls and quizzes for Bluesky</span></div></div><p>Ask the question, post it as a card, and let Bluesky vote. Quizzes too, with scores.</p><a class="go" href="https://skypoll.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open SkyPoll →</a></li>
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/clearat.png" alt=""><div><b>Clear AT</b><span class="tag">Clear your @s</span></div></div><p>One badge for all your notifications: every Bluesky account, plus RSS and YouTube. Triage at a glance, act on the site it came from. Free.</p><a class="go" href="https://clearat.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Clear AT →</a></li>
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/faceslop.png" alt=""><div><b>FaceSlop</b><span class="tag">Hand-made memes, no generative AI</span></div></div><p>Chop, shop and slop your own photos: face swaps, text, stickers, animation, voice-overs and long posts as video, posted or scheduled to Bluesky from your browser.</p><a class="go" href="https://faceslop.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open FaceSlop →</a></li>
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/alttext.png" alt=""><div><b>ALTtext</b><span class="tag">Free ALT text for any image</span></div></div><p>Accessible ALT text in seconds, no account. One click inside Bluesky, X, Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, Threads, Mastodon and more with the browser extension, or drop an image on the site.</p><a class="go" href="https://alttext.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open ALTtext →</a></li>
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/blueharbor.png" alt=""><div><b>BlueHarbor <span class="badge">NEW</span></b><span class="tag">Group chat and video calls, anchored to your Bluesky identity</span></div></div><p>Harbors, channels and memberships live as records in your own repo; chat, calls and live broadcasting run through the service. Every harbor is a TV station on The Bluesky Show.</p><a class="go" href="https://blueharbor.at" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open BlueHarbor →</a></li>
</ul>
<h3>Apps</h3>
<ul class="pg">
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/fitpet.png" alt=""><div><b>FitPet</b><span class="tag">Habit &amp; life coach on your wrist</span></div></div><p>A tiny pet on your Apple Watch and iPhone that turns your real goals into keeping a creature happy. Water, meds, movement, time outside, the habit you are quitting: it nags in its own voice, then celebrates when you follow through.</p><a class="go" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/fitpet-habit-life-coach/id6788170171" target="_blank" rel="noopener">App Store →</a></li>
</ul>
<h3>Watch and play</h3>
<ul class="pg">
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/blueskyshow.svg" alt=""><div><b>The Bluesky Show</b><span class="tag">Live, unscripted, straight from the AT Protocol</span></div></div><p>A live show made from what people post. Watch free, no account needed.</p><a class="go" href="https://blueskyshow.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch →</a></li>
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/skyrealm.png" alt=""><div><b>SkyRealm <span class="badge">BETA</span></b><span class="tag">A crowd-played adventure on Bluesky</span></div></div><p>A Dungeon Master writes the scene, everyone votes on what the party does, and the dice decide, right in the thread.</p><a class="go" href="https://skyrealm.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Play SkyRealm →</a></li>
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/gamethesky.png" alt=""><div><b>Game the Sky</b><span class="tag">Small games on the open sky</span></div></div><p>Race the Sky (one-touch slingshot racing) and Golf the Sky (speed golf in the night sky). You play as your Bluesky account; what you make is yours.</p><a class="go" href="https://gamethesky.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See the games →</a></li>
</ul>
<h3>Read, watch and make</h3>
<ul class="pg">
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/adblock.svg" alt=""><div><b>AdBlock.video</b><span class="tag">Ad-free YouTube</span></div></div><p>Watch and subscribe without ads: browser extension, web app, or comment #AdBlock on Bluesky and get an ad-free link back.</p><a class="go" href="https://adblock.video" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open AdBlock.video →</a></li>
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/clipslide.svg" alt=""><div><b>ClipSlide</b><span class="tag">Slideshows from photos and YouTube</span></div></div><p>Build shareable galleries with a drag-and-drop editor, automatic transitions and Clip & Hide quizzes.</p><a class="go" href="https://clipslide.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open ClipSlide →</a></li>
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/unwall.png" alt=""><div><b>UnWall</b><span class="tag">Read the whole article</span></div></div><p>Paywalls, cookie walls, ads and overlays stripped into a clean reader view. Paste a URL and open it instantly.</p><a class="go" href="https://unwall.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open UnWall →</a></li>
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/alter.png" alt=""><div><b>ALTer</b><span class="tag">The pro media editor for the Mac</span></div></div><p>A photo and video library that references your originals: non-destructive timeline edits, AI descriptions, accessible web galleries, and Bluesky posting with ALT text attached automatically.</p><a class="go" href="https://altermedia.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get ALTer →</a></li>
</ul>
<h3>Publish your own site</h3>
<ul class="pg">
<li class="pc"><div class="ph"><img src="/images/content-blocks/projects/pirate.svg" alt=""><div><b>Pirate Social</b><span class="tag">A distributed social network</span></div></div><p>Bluesky, RSS and YouTube in one feed, hosted on your own free website with an integrated CMS.</p><a class="go" href="https://piratesocial.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Pirate Social →</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
